  "description": "The GRAVEL MONSTER is a beast. Built for performance. It is a no compromise Gravel Racer. Light, stiff, and tuned for speed and control on the most challenging terrain from loose gravel descents to hairy single track. This bike will excel in gravel events like the Unbound and Grinduro. Perfect if you look for the road less traveled and want the machine that is capable to handle any thing you might encounter. From the uneven asphalt that takes you to the head of the trail to a weekend grasshopper event. A fast, capable, performance beast! Clearance for 27.5 x 2.25 and 50mm x 700c Made from the highest quality materials right here in Brooklyn, NY - one buy one- by hand - with love. Wait times fluctuate so please inquire on timing. Price is for frame and Enve G fork only. Offered with any single color and accent color of your choice from our custom paint shop. Specs and options below.",
